# A WebAssembly registry whose rows claim reachability the corpus and the execution checks do not give them.
#
# One defect per row: an entry the manifest does not have; an entry that records another code; an
# entry of the inversion sweep, whose answer was recorded from the profile rather than written down
# before it was asked; a row claiming no named case reaches it when a derived entry does, and the
# rule does not list it; a row the rule lists as unreached, in other words than the rule's; a row
# the rule lists as unreached claiming a corpus entry; a trap kind the payload mapping maps onto
# another code; a trap kind no execution check expects; a check the hook lane does not have; and a
# check the hook lane has, which expects another code and reason.
#
# registry-revision: 1
#
# code|name|pass|carrier|reason|reachability|case|since
2001|WrongMagic|decode|translation|MalformedEncoding|corpus|a-corpus-entry-nobody-wrote|1
2002|UnsupportedBinaryVersion|decode|translation|UnknownFormatVersion|corpus|preamble-wrong-magic|1
2106|Truncated|decode+validate|translation|Truncated|corpus|inversion-0071|1
2105|TagSectionNotAdmitted|decode|translation|UnknownFeature|unreached|No module carries one.|1
2901|VerifierDefect|validate+hook+translate|translation+outcome|InconsistentStructure|unreached|The validator cannot fail.|1
2107|ReaderMalformedEncoding|decode+validate|translation|MalformedEncoding|corpus|preamble-truncated|1
3001|TrapUnreachable|execute|payload|ProfileFaultUnspecified|execution|WasmTrapKind.IntegerOverflow|1
3002|TrapIntegerDivideByZero|execute|payload|ProfileFaultUnspecified|execution|WasmTrapKind.UndefinedElement|1
2851|ModuleDefinitionsMissing|hook|outcome|InconsistentStructure|hook-check|hook-a-check-nobody-wrote|1
